				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ac280c2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading" data-id="ac280c2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-title.default">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Record Quarterly Earnings: Chesapeake Financial Shares Second Quarter Financials and Declares Dividend</h1>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0b94dd5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-featured-image elementor-widget-image" data-id="0b94dd5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-featured-image.default">
															<img fetchpriority="high" width="768" height="403" src="https://ches.bank/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Featured-Images-Sized-2-768x403.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-20352" alt="" srcset="https://ches.bank/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Featured-Images-Sized-2-768x403.jpg 768w, https://ches.bank/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Featured-Images-Sized-2-300x158.jpg 300w, https://ches.bank/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Featured-Images-Sized-2-1024x538.jpg 1024w, https://ches.bank/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Featured-Images-Sized-2.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" />															</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-258edfe elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content" data-id="258edfe" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-content.default">
					
<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://youtu.be/AdDa9kHmrFY?feature=shared" style="color:#012e5b;background-color:#6bc5b4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">CLICK TO WATCH</a></div>
</div>



<div style="height:16px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">A “Top Performing Community Bank” in the U.S. for the nineteenth consecutive year</h4>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">As we continue celebrating over 125 years as an independent community bank, we&#8217;re pleased to share exciting news about our performance.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The second quarter of 2026 was the strongest in our company’s history.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We reported record quarterly earnings of <strong>more than $8.1 million</strong>, or <strong>$1.74 per diluted share</strong>. These results included a one-time after-tax gain of approximately <strong>$2.7 million</strong>&nbsp;from the sale of our ownership interest in Bearing Insurance, while also reflecting the continued strength of our core business.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our growth remains both consistent and organic. Total assets reached nearly <strong>$1.73 billion</strong>, increasing <strong>5.8% from a year ago</strong>. Even more impressive, total assets have grown <strong>44% since the end of 2020</strong>, demonstrating the momentum we’ve built through long-term relationship banking and a commitment to serving our communities. After all, it’s a marathon, not a sprint – as Chessie would agree.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We also continue to maintain exceptional asset quality. Nonperforming assets remain well below peer group averages, reflecting the disciplined approach to risk management and customer service that has defined Chesapeake for generations.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our Board of Directors recently declared a quarterly dividend of <strong>18 cents per share</strong>, extending our remarkable record of <strong>33 consecutive years of dividend increases</strong>. And over the past year, our stock price has <strong>increased by 82%,</strong>&nbsp;creating substantial value for our shareholders.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">“We couldn’t have achieved this milestone without the support of our customers, shareholders, employees, and communities. We are only as strong as the communities we serve&#8230;thank you for being part of our success.&#8221; &#8211; Becky Foster, Executive Vice President, COO, and CFO of Chesapeake Bank.</p>
</blockquote>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Record earnings are worth celebrating, but they’re really the result of something even more important: the relationships in the community we’ve built together.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Read the full <a href="https://www.accessnewswire.com/newsroom/en/banking-and-financial-services/chesapeake-financial-shares-reports-second-quarter-financials-and-de-1193965">press release</a> for a closer look at the financial results and the momentum driving our continued success. </p>



<div style="height:15px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Want to Own Local?</h4>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">When you invest in Chesapeake Financial Shares, you’re doing more than buying stock — you’re owning a piece of your community. As a locally headquartered and independently operated financial institution, your investment helps keep decision-making local, supports small businesses, and strengthens the regional economy. It’s not just smart investing — it’s meaningful ownership.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Chesapeake Financial Shares, Inc.&#8217;s common stock is publicly traded on the over-the-counter market under the symbol CPKF. For current market data, view <a href="https://www.otcmarkets.com/stock/CPKF/quote">here</a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">To purchase stock in Chesapeake Financial Shares, Inc., you will need an account with a brokerage firm that trades in OTC securities. The firm of your choice can complete your transaction, or we can assist you and provide additional information:</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Mrs. Rebecca Foster<br>(804) 435-3151<br>InvestorRelations@ches.bank</p>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://chesapeakefinancialshares.com/contact/faqs-1/default.aspx" style="color:#012e5b;background-color:#6bc5b4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Investor FAQ</a></div>
</div>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For more information about Chesapeake Financial Shares stock (CPKF), or to receive daily e-mail alerts of our stock price, see <a href="http://www.chesapeakefinancialshares.com">www.chesapeakefinancialshares.com</a>.&nbsp; The company is followed by Zacks Investment Research, and a copy of their report can also be found on this site or at <a href="http://www.zacks.com">www.zacks.com</a>. Follow <a href="http://www.ches.bank/">Chesapeake Bank</a> on <a href="https://www.facebook.com/chesbank/">Facebook</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/chesbank/">Instagram</a>, <a href="https://www.threads.net/@chesbank">Threads</a>, <a href="https://x.com/chesbank">X</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/chesbank/?viewAsMember=true">LinkedIn</a>, and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1BOWt4C7H-j4ACRh-1qHbA">YouTube</a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
